      "title": "Cambridge School Leadership Conference: Transforming Indian Education",
      "description": "In a landmark initiative, Cambridge Education Lab, organised a transformative Executive Leadership Conference for Indian School Leaders at the University of Cambridge, UK. The week-long program, held from 2nd to 9th July 2023 at Fitzwilliam College, University of Cambridge, brought together over 30 school owners from more than 10 Indian states, fostering collaboration and innovation.Fostering Global Academic Collaboration:The central theme of the conference was to explore innovative avenues for",
